The bot’s HP was increased from the 100 HP specified in the
initial design to 300 HP because a 100 HP bot would be eliminated
in approximately two seconds under maximum simultaneous NPC
attack, an episode too short for agents to encounter diverse game
states. At 300 HP, episodes last long enough to provide the training-
signal diversity needed for policy convergence.
